地中间要立心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晏 其一","author":"洪咨夔","text":"得路只轮车易上，失时独幅被难眠。\n淡黄齑饭茅柴酒，东掩西遮也过年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晏 其二","author":"洪咨夔","text":"百想卧轮翻伎俩，三生圆泽弄精魂。\n何如静对梅花坐，春满江南雪后村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次及甫入峡杂咏 其一 三游洞","author":"洪咨夔","text":"寥阳殿古琼关启，祇树园深宝盖张。\n长啸一声空响答，只疑惊起橘中商。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次及甫入峡杂咏 其二 三游洞","author":"洪咨夔","text":"披苔觅字双明健，倚树商诗两鬓皤。\n地划天开今几世，往来人物尽消磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次及甫入峡杂咏 平善坝","author":"洪咨夔","text":"水风静处抛船易，山雨晴时着句难。\n便向个中占好谶，一程平善过云安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":39325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次及甫入峡杂咏 至喜亭","author":"洪咨夔","text":"巴峡头边第一州，竹枝歌里水东流。\n盖亭老柳今如此，六一先生几系舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","prove